    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">On February 4, 2026, 38,500 restricted stock units previously granted to Ms. Saravia under the Company's 2020 Omnibus Incentive Plan (the &quot;Plan&quot;) vested and converted into shares of the Company's common stock on a one-for-one basis.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F2">On Feb 4, 2026 the Company granted Ms. Saravia 18,780 restricted stock units under the Plan. Each restricted stock unit represents a contingent right to receive one share of common stock. The restricted stock units granted will vest on Feb 4, 2027, and will be settled upon vesting (or within 30 days thereafter).</footnote>
